Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.09,0:00:01.19,MAX,,0,0,0,,OR LEAVING THE BACK DOOR
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.19,0:00:03.18,MAX,,0,0,0,,OPEN? OR FIXING YOUR PUMPKIN?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.46,0:00:04.72,SKYE,,0,0,0,,BUT ON THE PHONE. I HEARD
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.72,0:00:06.45,SKYE,,0,0,0,,YOU. YOU SAID I WAS THE WORST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.41,MAX,,0,0,0,,YOU LEFT TOO EARLY. I
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.41,0:00:10.11,MAX,,0,0,0,,SAID, SKYE IS THE WORST
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.11,0:00:11.57,MAX,,0,0,0,,AT HIDING. SHE'S BEEN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.57,0:00:13.04,MAX,,0,0,0,,IN OUR ATTIC ALL WEEK.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.12,0:00:13.74,MAX,,0,0,0,,AND THEN I SAID
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.74,0:00:14.56,MAX,,0,0,0,,I'M ASKING HER TO
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.56,0:00:17.15,MAX,,0,0,0,,THE DANCE. IF SHE EVER COMES DOWN.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.37,0:00:19.33,SKYE,,0,0,0,,YOU WERE NICE TO ME ALL WEEK
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.33,0:00:21.26,SKYE,,0,0,0,,BECAUSE A FRIDGE TOLD YOU TO.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.31,0:00:23.20,MAX,,0,0,0,,IT WAS A VERY CONVINCING FRIDGE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.67,SKYE,,0,0,0,,THEN WHY DIDN'T YOU
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.20,SKYE,,0,0,0,,TELL ANYONE I WAS HERE?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:28.08,MAX,,0,0,0,,BECAUSE BEFORE YOU HAUNTED IT,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.83,MAX,,0,0,0,,THIS HOUSE WAS REALLY BORING.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.07,0:00:33.08,DAD,,0,0,0,,MAX? WHO ARE YOU TALKING TO?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.20,0:00:33.97,MAX,,0,0,0,,NOBODY!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.01,SKYE,,0,0,0,,NOBODY!
